# Snake Game — Cursor Rules

## Architecture

Three strict layers. Never cross the boundary upward.

- `lib/balance/` — constants only, no imports, no logic
- `lib/game/logic/`, `lib/game/bot/`, `lib/progression/` — pure Dart, NO Flutter/Flame imports
- `lib/game/components/`, `lib/game/snake_game.dart` — Flame rendering only
- `lib/ui/` — Flutter screens and widgets

## Critical Rules

1. Logic files (`lib/game/logic/`, `lib/game/bot/`, `lib/progression/`) must
   never contain `import 'package:flame/...'` or `import 'package:flutter/...'`

2. Game numbers (speeds, goals, XP, bot counts) belong in `lib/balance/`.
   Never hardcode them in logic or UI files.

3. Widget files must use design tokens — never raw values:
   - Colors → `AppColors.*`
   - Text styles → `AppTextStyles.*`
   - Spacing → `AppDimensions.*`
   - Animations → `AppAnimations.*`

4. Every logic change needs a test in `test/logic/`.

5. No ads, no analytics, no network calls, no multiplayer server code.

## Commands

```bash
flutter test          # all tests
dart analyze lib/     # static analysis
flutter test test/logic/  # fast logic-only tests
```

## File Map

| Goal | File |
|---|---|
| Tune a number | `lib/balance/*.dart` |
| Fix movement | `lib/game/logic/movement_logic.dart` |
| Fix collisions | `lib/game/logic/collision_logic.dart` |
| Fix bot AI | `lib/game/bot/*.dart` |
| Fix visuals | `lib/game/components/*.dart` |
| Fix a screen | `lib/ui/screens/*.dart` |
| Fix colors | `lib/ui/theme/app_colors.dart` |
